### Exemplos de uso da API de Pagamentos com Stripe

### 1. Criar sessão de checkout para pagamento único
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_usuario": 1,
  "tipo_plano": "monthly",
  "success_url": "http://localhost:3000/success",
  "cancel_url": "http://localhost:3000/cancel"
}

### 2. Criar sessão de checkout para assinatura recorrente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/subscription-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_usuario": 1,
  "lookup_key": "premium_monthly",
  "success_url": "http://localhost:3000/success",
  "cancel_url": "http://localhost:3000/cancel"
}

### 3. Criar sessão do portal de cobrança do cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/customer-portal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "cs_test_1234567890"
}

### 4. Processar webhook do Stripe (simulado)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature_hash

{
  "id": "evt_1234567890",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_1234567890",
      "object": "checkout.session",
      "amount_total": 2990,
      "currency": "brl",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "customer_email": "usuario@exemplo.com",
      "payment_status": "paid",
      "status": "complete",
      "url": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/cs_test_1234567890",
      "metadata": {
        "user_id": "1",
        "tipo_plano": "monthly"
      }
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}

### 5. Buscar histórico de pagamento por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/historicos/1

### 6. Listar todos os históricos de pagamento
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/historicos

### 7. Buscar históricos de pagamento de um usuário específico
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/1/historicos-pagamento

### 8. Soft delete de histórico de pagamento
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/historicos/1

### 9. Restaurar histórico de pagamento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/historicos/1/restore

### Exemplos de webhooks do Stripe para diferentes eventos:

### Webhook - Assinatura criada
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature_hash

{
  "id": "evt_subscription_created",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "customer.subscription.created",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "sub_1234567890",
      "object": "subscription",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "status": "active",
      "current_period_start": 1234567890,
      "current_period_end": 1237156290
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}

### Webhook - Assinatura atualizada
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature_hash

{
  "id": "evt_subscription_updated",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "customer.subscription.updated",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "sub_1234567890",
      "object": "subscription",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "status": "active",
      "current_period_start": 1234567890,
      "current_period_end": 1237156290
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}

### Webhook - Assinatura cancelada
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature_hash

{
  "id": "evt_subscription_deleted",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "customer.subscription.deleted",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "sub_1234567890",
      "object": "subscription",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "status": "canceled",
      "canceled_at": 1234567890
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}

### Webhook - Trial prestes a acabar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature_hash

{
  "id": "evt_trial_will_end",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "customer.subscription.trial_will_end",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "sub_1234567890",
      "object": "subscription",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "status": "trialing",
      "trial_end": 1234567890
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}
